        "cooked": "<p>Number 1 is correct. <em>Let Them Break Themselves Against the Stone</em> reads in part, \"After Invaders deal 1 or more Damage to target land, 2 Damage.\" Thus, <em>LTBTAtS</em> deals its Damage <em>after</em> the Invaders deal their's to the land.</p>\n<p>And welcome to the Forums!</p>\n<p>Edit: Ninja'd.</p>",
